---
---

<div class="bento-group startups-group">
  <section id="startups" class="tile founders-head" style="--i:6">
    <span class="label">02 — Startup Consulting</span>
    <h2>AI Consulting for Startups</h2>
    <p>
      We work with startup teams as their AI partner — from finding where AI creates real value to shipping it in production.
    </p>
  </section>

  <article class="tile founder" style="--i:7">
    <svg class="bg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6" />
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" />
    </svg>
    <h3>AI Strategy</h3>
    <p>Identifying where AI can create the most value in your business.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="tile founder founder--purple" style="--i:8">
    <svg class="bg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z" />
    </svg>
    <h3>Technical Partnership</h3>
    <p>Hands-on support from research to production-ready solutions.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="tile founder" style="--i:9">
    <svg class="bg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17" />
      <polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13" />
    </svg>
    <h3>Growth Acceleration</h3>
    <p>Leveraging cutting-edge AI to scale faster and smarter.</p>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  /* Wider intro tile next to three equal ones — doesn't fit the shared 12 columns */
  .startups-group {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) repeat(3, minmax(0, 3fr));
  }

  .founders-head,
  .founder {
    grid-column: auto;
  }

  .tile.founders-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .founder {
    min-height: 180px;
  }

  .founder--purple .bg-icon {
    color: var(--color-purple-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .startups-group {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .founders-head {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .founder {
      min-height: 140px;
    }
  }
</style>
